#' Landmark Target-Trial Analysis
#'
#' Constructs aligned landmark cohorts for two treatment-decision windows,
#' classifies two binary treatment components into four strategies, and
#' estimates within-stratum AIPW and IPTW effects with timing audits,
#' clustered inference, separation handling, and publication-ready plots.
#' 
#' @param data .
#' @param eligibility .
#' @param treatmentA .
#' @param treatmentB .
#' @param outcome .
#' @param failureEvent1 .
#' @param failureEvent2 .
#' @param competingEvent .
#' @param cluster .
#' @param indexTime .
#' @param treatmentATime .
#' @param treatmentBTime .
#' @param failureTime1 .
#' @param failureTime2 .
#' @param dischargeTime .
#' @param competingTime .
#' @param covariates .
#' @param absenceVars .
#' @param eligibilityPositive .
#' @param treatmentAPositive .
#' @param treatmentBPositive .
#' @param outcomePositive .
#' @param outcomeSource .
#' @param competingHandling .
#' @param timeMode .
#' @param timeUnit .
#' @param window1 .
#' @param runSecondWindow .
#' @param window2 .
#' @param unknownTreatment .
#' @param unknownEvent .
#' @param runBothStrata .
#' @param primaryStratum .
#' @param primaryWindow .
#' @param missingMethod .
#' @param imputations .
#' @param outcomeMethod .
#' @param propensityMethod .
#' @param minPS .
#' @param maxPS .
#' @param bootstrapSamples .
#' @param randomSeed .
#' @param confidenceLevel .
#' @param effectMeasure .
#' @param showFlowPlot .
#' @param showBalancePlot .
#' @param showEffectPlot .
#' @param showSyntax .
#' @return A results object containing:
#' \tabular{llllll}{
#'   \code{results$summary} \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab a table \cr
#'   \code{results$flow} \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab a table \cr
#'   \code{results$timeline} \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab a table \cr
#'   \code{results$strategies} \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab a table \cr
#'   \code{results$effects} \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab a table \cr
#'   \code{results$balance} \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab a table \cr
#'   \code{results$flowPlot} \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab an image \cr
#'   \code{results$balancePlot} \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab an image \cr
#'   \code{results$effectPlot} \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab an image \cr
#'   \code{results$notes} \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab a preformatted \cr
#'   \code{results$syntax} \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab a preformatted \cr
#' }
#'
#' Tables can be converted to data frames with \code{asDF} or \code{\link{as.data.frame}}. For example:
#'
#' \code{results$summary$asDF}
#'
#' \code{as.data.frame(results$summary)}
#'
#' @export
